WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.424
Quadrilateral clue card 1: which quadrilateral best matches four right angles and two

00:00:05.424 --> 00:00:10.648
longer sides plus two shorter sides? Let us think carefully. Rectangle matches these

00:00:10.648 --> 00:00:15.471
attributes. Some categories can overlap; use the intended most specific name. The

00:00:15.471 --> 00:00:17.480
answer is rectangle. Great work!

00:00:18.283 --> 00:00:23.503
Quadrilateral clue card 2: which quadrilateral best matches four equal sides and four

00:00:23.503 --> 00:00:27.919
right angles? Let us think carefully. Square matches these attributes. Some

00:00:27.919 --> 00:00:33.139
categories can overlap; use the intended most specific name. The answer is square.

00:00:33.139 --> 00:00:33.942
Great work!

00:00:34.783 --> 00:00:40.053
Quadrilateral clue card 3: which quadrilateral best matches four equal sides and no

00:00:40.053 --> 00:00:44.511
right angles? Let us think carefully. Rhombus matches these attributes. Some

00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:49.781
categories can overlap; use the intended most specific name. The answer is rhombus.

00:00:49.781 --> 00:00:50.591
Great work!

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:56.375
Quadrilateral clue card 4: which quadrilateral best matches two pairs of parallel

00:00:56.375 --> 00:01:01.711
sides, no right angles and adjacent sides of different lengths? Let us think

00:01:01.711 --> 00:01:05.815
carefully. Parallelogram matches these attributes. Some categories can overlap; use

00:01:05.815 --> 00:01:10.330
the intended most specific name. The answer is parallelogram. Great work!
